#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: lokalize.appdata.xml:9
msgid ""
"Lokalize is the localization tool for KDE and other open source software. It "
"is also a general computer-aided translation system (CAT) with which you can "
"translate OpenDocument files (*.odt). Translate-Toolkit is used internally to "
"extract text for translation from .odt to .xliff files and to merge "
"translation back into .odt file."
msgstr ""

